{
  "articles": [
    {
      "id": "im-01-regular",
      "title": "Step 1: Commands with regular verbs",
      "fr": "l'impératif des verbes réguliers",
      "level": "A1",
      "keywords": [
        "step by step",
        "imperative",
        "impératif",
        "commands",
        "orders",
        "let's",
        "tu nous vous",
        "écoute",
        "finis"
      ],
      "topics": [],
      "see": [
        "imperative"
      ],
      "tense": "imperatif-present",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "In short",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "A command uses only three persons, **tu, nous, vous**, and **no subject**: *Écoute ! Écoutons ! Écoutez !* The forms are the present tense without the subject, with one change: *-er* verbs drop the **-s** of the *tu* form."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "head": [
                "present",
                "command",
                "meaning"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "tu écoutes",
                  "Écoute !",
                  "Listen! (one friend)"
                ],
                [
                  "nous écoutons",
                  "Écoutons !",
                  "Let's listen!"
                ],
                [
                  "vous écoutez",
                  "Écoutez !",
                  "Listen! (several people, or polite)"
                ]
              ],
              "textCols": [
                2
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "-er verbs: no -s for tu",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "verb": "parler",
              "tense": "imperatif-present"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "*Tu parles → Parle !* *Tu manges → Mange !* Verbs like *ouvrir* and *offrir* also drop it: *Ouvre la porte !*"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "form",
                "verb": "regarder",
                "tense": "imperatif-present",
                "person": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "-ir and -re verbs keep the -s",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "verb": "finir",
              "tense": "imperatif-present"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "*Finis ! Choisis ! Attends ! Prends ! Écris !* The *tu* form is exactly the present."
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "form",
                "verb": "attendre",
                "tense": "imperatif-present",
                "person": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Nous: let's",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The *nous* form means **let's**: *Allons au cinéma !* (Let's go to the cinema!) *Mangeons !* (Let's eat!)"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "cloze",
                "fr": "On a faim : ___ une pizza !",
                "a": [
                  "mangeons"
                ],
                "hint": "manger",
                "en": "We're hungry: let's eat a pizza!"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Watch out",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "en": "*Aller* behaves like an *-er* verb: *Va au lit !* (no -s)."
            },
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "en": "*Vous* is for several people **and** for one adult you say *vous* to: *Entrez, madame !*"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Examples",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Regarde ce chien !",
                  "en": "Look at that dog!"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Finissez vos devoirs !",
                  "en": "Finish your homework!"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Prends ton manteau, il fait froid.",
                  "en": "Take your coat, it's cold."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Attendez ici, s'il vous plaît.",
                  "en": "Wait here, please."
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Parlons français !",
                  "en": "Let's speak French!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
