    {
      "id": "im-04-reflexive",
      "title": "Step 4: Reflexive verbs: Lève-toi ! Ne te lève pas !",
      "fr": "l'impératif des verbes pronominaux",
      "level": "A2",
      "keywords": [
        "step by step",
        "imperative",
        "reflexive",
        "lève-toi",
        "assieds-toi",
        "dépêche-toi",
        "ne t'inquiète pas",
        "toi",
        "vous"
      ],
      "topics": [],
      "see": [
        "reflexive-pronouns",
        "imperative"
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "In short",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "Reflexive verbs keep their pronoun, but it moves **after** the verb with a hyphen, and *te* becomes **toi**: *Lève-toi ! Levons-nous ! Levez-vous !* In the negative it goes back in front: *Ne te lève pas !*"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "verb": "se lever",
              "tense": "imperatif-present"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Affirmative: after the verb",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "The most common ones: *Dépêche-toi !* (Hurry up!) *Assieds-toi !* (Sit down!) *Calme-toi !* (Calm down!) *Tais-toi !* (Be quiet!) *Amuse-toi bien !* (Have fun!) *Repose-toi !* (Get some rest!)"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "transform",
                "task_en": "Turn it into a command",
                "fr": "Tu te couches.",
                "a": [
                  "Couche-toi !"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Negative: back in front",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "*Ne* + pronoun + verb + *pas*, and *toi* goes back to *te*: *Ne t'inquiète pas !* (Don't worry!) *Ne vous asseyez pas là !*"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "transform",
                "task_en": "Make the command negative",
                "fr": "Habille-toi !",
                "a": [
                  "Ne t'habille pas !"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Watch out",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "en": "Keep the hyphen: *Lève-toi*, not *Lève toi*."
            },
            {
              "type": "tip",
              "en": "Only *te* changes. *Nous* and *vous* stay: *Promenons-nous ! Ne nous promenons pas !*"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Examples",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Dépêche-toi, le bus arrive !",
