    {
      "id": "im-05-pronouns",
      "title": "Step 5: Commands with object pronouns",
      "fr": "l'impératif avec un pronom",
      "level": "A2",
      "keywords": [
        "step by step",
        "imperative",
        "pronouns",
        "prends-le",
        "dis-lui",
        "vas-y",
        "aide-moi",
        "ne le prends pas"
      ],
      "topics": [],
      "see": [
        "pp-15-commands",
        "pronouns-imperative"
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "In short",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "Object pronouns follow the same rule as reflexive ones: **after** the verb with a hyphen in the affirmative (*Prends-le !*), **before** it in the negative (*Ne le prends pas !*). *Me* becomes **moi**: *Aide-moi !* Step 15 of *Object pronouns step by step* goes deeper, with two pronouns."
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "head": [
                "affirmative",
                "negative"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Prends-le !",
                  "Ne le prends pas !"
                ],
                [
                  "Parle-lui !",
                  "Ne lui parle pas !"
                ],
                [
                  "Aide-moi !",
                  "Ne m'aide pas !"
                ],
                [
                  "Vas-y !",
                  "N'y va pas !"
                ],
                [
                  "Prends-en !",
                  "N'en prends pas !"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Affirmative",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "Choose the pronoun as usual (step 1 of the pronoun path), then put it after the verb. Before *y* and *en* the *tu* form of *-er* verbs gets its *-s* back: *Vas-y ! Manges-en !*"
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "transform",
                "task_en": "Turn it into a command and replace the underlined words",
                "fr": "Tu achètes [le pain].",
                "a": [
                  "Achète-le !"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Negative",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "en": "Everything goes back to the normal order: *ne* + pronoun + verb + *pas*."
            },
            {
              "type": "check",
              "item": {
                "type": "transform",
                "task_en": "Make the command negative",
                "fr": "Mange-le !",
                "a": [
                  "Ne le mange pas !"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Examples",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "examples",
              "items": [
                {
                  "fr": "Ton portable ? Éteins-le !",
                  "en": "Your phone? Switch it off!"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Ta mère t'attend, appelle-la !",
                  "en": "Your mother is waiting, call her!"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Le parc ? Allons-y !",
                  "en": "The park? Let's go!"
                },
                {
                  "fr": "Ne me parle pas comme ça !",
                  "en": "Don't talk to me like that!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "g-im-05-pronouns-01",
